  DisplayName: Lancefall
  Description: 'Shrikes only - break the plates hanging in the cell. Your Void Lance breaks every block
    on its line, so a lance at a plate''s face takes a tile, but come round to its edge and
    lay the lance along the plate and it breaks a whole strip. Crystals widen the beam.
    Higher intensities turn and stack the plates and rib them with shields. First team to
    break the target wins.'
